// Debug configuration of the IzzyMap target (project.yml `configFiles`).
//
// The Google OAuth client id for the pins export (docs/PINS_PLAN.md §6)
// comes from Google.xcconfig, which is gitignored: the id is not a secret,
// but it stays out of the public repo. Write it on a Mac with
//   ios/Config/write-google-xcconfig.sh
// (reads ~/.config/izzymap/google.env). Without the file the setting is
// empty and the app simply doesn't offer "Google Docs" (Share file stays).
#include? "Google.xcconfig"
